      "arithmetic": "0.4842 = 92/190 exactly, and 190 - 92 = 98 gives 98/190 = 0.515789. doc 52's `sem manual` 1-feature value 0.6789 = 129/190 has an ODD numerator, which is impossible in the PAIR-LEVEL system (its counts are even out of 190) -- so doc 52's '1-feature' column was computed with the PER-TWIN general-C instrument.",
